  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the national TB response in priority groups (prisoners, DR-TB, TB/HIV) and strengthen the community system. - Peru (01-Jul-2016-30-Jun-2019)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peru, Tuberculosis, Socios en Salud sucursal Peru (SOCIOS EN SALUD)This program has the following goals: Progressive and sustainably decrease the incidence, morbidity and mortality from tuberculosis in prioritized scenarios and improve control of the disease in highly vulnerable groups.. The objectives of this program are: Consolidate a comprehensive and inovative response for the control of people affected with multidrug resistant TB and extensively resistant TB..  Strengthen the response to TB in prisons through intensive interventions, and articulated and targeted strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
